1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:02,085
(Amy:)I'm sorry you got stuck with me.

2
00:00:02,243 --> 00:00:03,583
(Amy:)I bet you wanted
to be with Bernadette.

3
00:00:04,845 --> 00:00:06,255
(Howard:)Have you ever played
a game with Bernadette?

4
00:00:06,413 --> 00:00:07,953
(Raj:)-No.
-Have you ever gone

5
00:00:08,115 --> 00:00:10,595
(Howard:)into a steel cage with a wolverine?

6
00:00:11,685 --> 00:00:14,185
(Bernadette:)Faster, faster, faster!
Do you not know that word?

7
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:18,065
-It means "more fast"!
-Stop yelling at me.

8
00:00:18,225 --> 00:00:21,965
Hey! You'll know
when I'm yelling at you.

9
00:00:22,563 --> 00:00:24,803
Oh. Oh, it's the comic book store!
All right, come on.

10
00:00:24,965 --> 00:00:26,275
(Penny:)That's where we have to go.

11
00:00:26,433 --> 00:00:27,883
(Sheldon:)But we haven't finished the puzzle.

12
00:00:28,035 --> 00:00:31,385
Well, it doesn't matter!
We know the answer!

13
00:00:31,539 --> 00:00:35,249
(Sheldon:)You think you know the answer.
But it could be a trick.

14
00:00:35,409 --> 00:00:37,219
(Sheldon:)What if when the puzzle's complete,

15
00:00:37,378 --> 00:00:39,118
(Sheldon:)there's a sign
in the window that says,

16
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,780
"Go to the train store"?

17
00:00:40,948 --> 00:00:42,788
(Penny:)Okay, it's not gonna say that.

18
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:47,090
(Sheldon:)Well, I hope you're wrong.
I really want to go to the train store.

19
00:00:48,822 --> 00:00:51,462
It's the comic book store. Let's go!

20
00:00:51,625 --> 00:01:00,025
(Bernadette:)Come on, numb nuts,
it's the comic book store!

